    "saved_slices": "New seeded sections and cameras were selected for several atlas entries. Central holdout and quadric-contact slices were released from fixed-coordinate-ratio restrictions after their heavy display denominators were retired. Other exact restricted displays retain their required section relation.",
    "floating_point_fixes": "The divisor evaluator now stores a shared power-of-two exponent for each value and six derivatives, renormalizes products and aligns sums. Later code uses exact 2^64 shifts and projects derivatives to a surface-tangent per-pixel motion to estimate Newton distance, with multiplicity compensation and squared-modulus treatment of complex factors.",
